  "id": "school-avoidance",
  "term": "school avoidance",
  "definition": "School avoidance, in this packet’s context, refers to emotionally based school avoidance in children and adolescents. It describes a school-related difficulty linked to emotional factors, and some young people do not improve with outpatient mental health care, so more intensive support may sometimes be considered.",
